[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/3","id":6575103573,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVwLPE88AAAABRdQQIg","number":3,"title":"Nariq hip gfx1100","user":{"login":"damarges","id":60487838,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNDg3ODM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60487838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges","html_url":"https://github.com/damarges","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damarges/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-24T05:09:41Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:04:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pulls/3","html_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/3.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Overview\n\nI don’t have an NVIDIA gpu, so I wanted to see if I could get nariq running on my AMD Radeon RX7900 XTX 24GB VRAM gpu. Works but speed leaves still room for improvement.\n\n## Hardware tested\n\n- GPU: AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX, 24 GB, RDNA3 (`gfx1100`)\n- Driver: Linux `amdgpu`, kernel `7.0.14-29-pve`\n- Runtime: ROCm/HIP 7.2.4\n- OS: Proxmox VE 9.2.32, Debian 13 host, Ubuntu 24.04 build container\n\n## Checks\n\n- NariQ tests: 4 logit-comparison unit tests passed. Full Python and CTest suites pending. Synthetic Trellis check failed at TRL1 with 35 input tokens (HIP: -10.3191; CPU: -10.3261).\n- Numerical check: original 3.0 bpw GGUF, HIP vs. CPU, 12/12 top-1 matches, identical greedy token IDs, max KL 1.99e-8. Independent F32 runtime parity, 2.5/2.0 bpw validation, and previous-build comparison pending.\n- Speed: HIP `llama-server`, Q8_0/Q8_0 KV, 261,632 uncached input tokens. Prefill: 165.82 tok/s. Decode: 5.18 tok/s over five output tokens. VRAM after request: 20.35 GiB. Same-machine `llama-bench` before/after pending.\n- [Build instructions and full benchmark results](https://github.com/damarges/nari-llama-amd/blob/nariq-hip-gfx1100/nariq/README-hip.md)\n## AI usage disclosure\nYes, assisted by openai's codex desktop app.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/2","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/2/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.gith