ecks and Windows artifacts) for b12431-nari2. It will be closed and its branch deleted once the artifacts are downloaded. Nothing is published from it.","closed_by":{"login":"shamuiscoding","id":75746908,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NzQ2OTA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75746908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding","html_url":"https://github.com/shamuiscoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/2/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/1","id":6418530127,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVwLPE88AAAABPfkzGQ","number":1,"title":"Add NariQ runtime and standalone build artifacts","user":{"login":"shamuiscoding","id":75746908,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NzQ2OTA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75746908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding","html_url":"https://github.com/shamuiscoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":13100125475,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVwLPE88AAAADDNQNIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":13100337779,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVwLPE88AAAADDNdKcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/labels/CUDA","name":"CUDA","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":13100337804,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVwLPE88AAAADDNdKjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/labels/testing","name":"testing","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":13100337827,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVwLPE88AAAADDNdKow","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/labels/devops","name":"devops","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":13100337850,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVwLPE88AAAADDNdKug","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/labels/conversion","name":"conversion","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":13100337867,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVwLPE88AAAADDNdKyw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/labels/ggml","name":"ggml","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":13100337894,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVwLPE88AAAADDNdK5g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/labels/model","name":"model","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-16T09:46:52Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:48Z","closed_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pulls/1","html_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/pull/1.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This imports the TRL1-TRL6 converter, loader, CPU operations and vendored CUDA/libtrellis implementation onto upstream b12431, so this fork can load NariQ GGUFs and build its own Linux/Docker and Windows packages.\n\nThe migration adds format-version and descriptor checks, rejects unsupported LoRA adapters, updates launcher platform/driver checks, and supplies source/compiler provenance, pinned UI assets, licenses, checksums and local candidate assembly. Assembly rejects incomplete archives and mismatched or dirty source revisions. Public documentation includes a self-contained format guide, fork-specific installation entry point, platform readiness checklist and desktop/server device coverage plan. Metal and Vulkan implementations, ARM64 packages, backend parity tests and upstream compatibility gates remain planned work.\n\nUpstream workflows are replaced with Linux/Apple Silicon CPU checks and Linux/Windows artifact builds. No workflow publishes a release or pushes an image.\n\nValidation completed:\n- Seven local model-independent CTest checks and seven launcher/packaging tests passed. Linux CPU CI and the Windows CPU build/numerical/metadata tests passed at runtime revision 70b6c0a; subsequent changes are documentation-only.\n- The full Linux CUDA 12.8 architecture build passed at 70b6c0a, with clean source provenance. Its archives passed checksums, extraction, pinned-UI and packaged CPU-backend loading checks, local candidate assembly and startup in a clean CUDA runtime container.\n- That exact Linux package loaded the hash-verified 3-bit, 2.5-bit and 2-bit models and generated tokens on CPU. A small vision request with the pinned BF16 projector also completed. These are functional smoke checks, not GPU parity or scored benchmark results.\n- PowerShell parsing and mocked supported/old-driver and failed-GPU-query checks passed.\n\nRemaining checks:\n- Hosted Linux and Windows full CUDA artifact builds and archive smoke checks passed at runtime revision 70b6c0a.\n- Apple Silicon CPU CI could not acquire a hosted runner because of GitHub capacity constraints. Both the initial attempt and its infrastructure retry failed to obtain a runner; ARM validation remains pending.\n- Exact-artifact GPU qualification is listed in nariq/release-readiness.md. Metal/Vulkan/HIP trellis kernels are not implemented.\n\nNo GPU server or scored benchmark was launched, and no release was published.\n\nImplementation and review preparation assisted by Codex.\n","closed_by":{"login":"shamuiscoding","id":75746908,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NzQ2OTA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75746908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding","html_url":"https://github.com/shamuiscoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamuiscoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nari-labs/nari-llama.cpp/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}]